//
// Scope (this task): Trigger step + Action step + the 4-pill step indicator.
// Constraints + Review steps are minimal placeholders (Task 6 fills them in).
//
// The api module is mocked so the wizard's on-mount loads resolve
// synchronously to fixed shapes:
//   - listTriggerTypes → 4 triggers (incl. keyword_detected w/ keywords + match)
//   - listActionTypes  → 11 actions (4 supported + 7 unsupported)
//   - listContactGroups / listChannels → one option each
//
// Queries by role/text/label — never getByTestId.

